{"id": "EUVD-2026-97615", "enisaUuid": "c6016821-509b-3fd2-add9-862ca48260b0", "description": "Grav Login plugin 2.7.0 before 3.9.9 contains an authentication bypass vulnerability that allows attackers with a valid password to skip two-factor authentication through remember-me cookie restoration. Attackers can obtain a persistent remember-me cookie after the password step and restore it as a fully authorized session without completing the second factor.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:08", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T15:47:59", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/getgrav/grav/security/advisories/GHSA-cmg5-qw8p-gxcf", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/grav-login-plugin-2.7.0-before-3.9.9-2fa-bypass-via-remember-me-cookie"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109313", "GHSA-mp6q-9gmf-c5j2"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.35, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4df33223-ab14-3e7d-907f-e9dc797392fd", "product": {"name": "grav-plugin-login", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}, "product_version": "2.7.0 <3.9.9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "dc48dc3d-6fd3-3ce1-a2e2-cba09da1f974", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}], "isExploited": false}